ct)\n      - pkg/hashutil/ (existing shared hash utility -- HashConfig, DigestFiles, ComputeDigest, FormatGNU)\n      - pkg/testutils/ (RunDiffTests and BuildBinary pattern)\n      - pkg/sys/ (InstallSIGPIPEHandler)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/md5sum/main.go\n        action: create\n        note: md5sum utility -- initial implementation for R1.1-R1.4\n      - path: cmd/md5sum/md5sum_test.go\n        action: create\n        note: Differential tests for R1.1-R1.4\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: Implement srd030-md5sum R1.1 per the SRD specification\n      - id: R2\n        text: Implement srd030-md5sum R1.2 per the SRD specification\n      - id: R3\n        text: Implement srd030-md5sum R1.3 per the SRD specification\n      - id: R4\n        text: Implement srd030-md5sum R1.4 per the SRD specification\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: Use pkg/hashutil.HashConfig with crypto/md5.New as the hash constructor and DigestLen 16\n      - id: D2\n        text: Use pkg/hashutil.DigestFiles for the core file-hashing workflow\n      - id: D3\n        text: Call sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() at start of main\n      - id: D4\n        text: Use pkg/testutils.RunDiffTests with gmd5sum as the reference binary\n      - id: D5\n        text: Skip tests if gmd5sum is not found via exec.LookPath\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: All R1.1-R1.4 requirements from srd030-md5sum are implemented\n      - id: AC2\n        text: Differential tests for R1.1-R1.4 pass against gmd5sum reference binary\n      - id: AC3\n        text: go build ./cmd/md5sum/ succeeds with no errors\n      - id: AC4\n        text: go test ./cmd/md5sum/ -count=1 passes\n      - id: AC5\n        text: go vet ./cmd/md5sum/ reports no issues\n\n- index: 2\n  title: \"[stitch] cmd/md5sum -- srd030 R2.1-R2.4\"\n  dependency: 1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd030-md5sum.yam